## About POAP KINGS

POAP KINGS is a Clash Royale clan that celebrates effort with proof. Each season and notable milestone is commemorated by an on-chain POAP ("Proof of Attendance Protocol") badge. The current roster is refreshed locally from the Clash Royale API and pushed when it changes.

